  "按 H 进入辅助飞行，E 升高。G 仅开关自动回正；关闭回正后，Z / B 可连续完整滚转，1 / 2 平滑改变俯仰。松键后控制器用实际喷力与力矩稳住新姿态，并尽量维持位置；WASD 与 E / Q 仍可移动。过大的倾角或倒置可能超出喷口承重能力，车辆会真实下落。X 从地面启动会返回地面，从空中启动会恢复起始高度附近；Q 接地后继续按住会完成降落，喷口按关阀时间衰减。默认外部持续供气，有限储气的自动翻转需通过余量与净空预检。风场实验室与城市可同页往返，捕获姿态、定点目标和自定义流程在研究控制台中设置；保存的 3–9 快捷键两处通用。倒悬与弧桥仍可用于吸附接触研究。": "H enables assisted flight; E climbs. G toggles auto-level only. With it off, Z / B command continuous rolls and 1 / 2 change pitch. Release the keys and the controller uses actual forces and torques to hold the reached attitude and, when feasible, position. WASD and E / Q still move. Large tilts or inversion can exceed support authority, causing real descent. X returns a ground start to the ground and an airborne start near its original height. Keeping Q pressed after ground contact completes landing; thrust decays with valve closing time. External supply is the default. Finite-air rolls require reserve and clearance checks. Switch between city and wind lab on the same page. Capture poses, set position targets and edit sequences in the research console; saved 3–9 shortcuts work in both scenes. Ceiling and arch tests remain available for suction research.",
